{"id":"28729f9f64189602","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-mm-run-invariant.md","title":"运行的解集与支持不变量","display":"thm-mm-run-invariant — 运行的解集与支持不变量","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-mm-run-invariant","aliases":["56-thm-mm-run-invariant"],"display":"thm-mm-run-invariant — 运行的解集与支持不变量","depends_on":["[[56-df-unification-problem]]","[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion]]","[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]","[[56-thm-mm-step-factorization]]","[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Proposition 7.7.3; proof of Theorem 7.7.6","source_printed_pages":"292–294","source_ocr_blocks":[313,314,315],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-mm-run-invariant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-mm-run-invariant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mm-run-invariant — 运行的解集与支持不变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8198395909603c44\" href=\"?note=8198395909603c44\" title=\"56-df-unification-problem\">56-df-unification-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0df0123405bbc66d\" href=\"?note=0df0123405bbc66d\" title=\"56-df-substitution-composition\">56-df-substitution-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e01b783dda59f5e\" href=\"?note=4e01b783dda59f5e\" title=\"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion\">56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3c6237425d7c09fc\" href=\"?note=3c6237425d7c09fc\" title=\"56-thm-mm-step-factorization\">56-thm-mm-step-factorization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Proposition 7.7.3; proof of Theorem 7.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"292–294"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>313</span><span>314</span><span>315</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol E=(E_0,\\ldots,E_n)\\in\\mathcal G_\\bot^{n+1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\delta\\in S^n\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{MMRun}(\\boldsymbol E,\\boldsymbol\\delta)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot\">\\(\\mathcal G,\\mathcal G_\\bot\\)</span> 及累积替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_i\">\\(a_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"38760d0fb2c20b34\" href=\"?note=38760d0fb2c20b34\" title=\"56-df-mm-unification-run\">56-df-mm-unification-run</a>；单步因子化见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3c6237425d7c09fc\" href=\"?note=3c6237425d7c09fc\" title=\"56-thm-mm-step-factorization\">56-thm-mm-step-factorization</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Idempotent}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dom},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Idempotent}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\le n\\;\\bigl(a_i\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\land\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a_i)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\le n\\;\\bigl(a_i\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\land\\operatorname{Idempotent}(a_i)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\le n\\;(E_i\\in\\mathcal G\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Dom}(a_i)\\cap\\operatorname{Vars}(E_i)=\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\le n\\;(E_i\\in\\mathcal G\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Dom}(a_i)\\cap\\operatorname{Vars}(E_i)=\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\le n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)=\\{a_i\\circ\\rho\\mid\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E_i)\\}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\le n\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sol}(E_0)=\\{a_i\\circ\\rho\\mid\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Sol}(E_i)\\}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地以运行长度归纳，展开命题7.7.3。恒等起点平凡。非消去规则标签为恒等；不会引入新变量。消去x=t时，既有支持D不在当前目标中，所以x∉D且Var(t)∩D为空。旧像不含D，接[x:=t]后也不含x；新像t也不含D∪{x}，于是新支持D∪{x}与其引入变量不交，新余目标也不含该支持。有限支持保持。解集等式由单步因子化及替换组合结合律归纳，结合律逐变量从项替换组合定律推出。若一步失败，末端解集为空，等式仍成立。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-unification-problem","status":"resolved","id":"8198395909603c44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-unification-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-composition","status":"resolved","id":"0df0123405bbc66d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"4e01b783dda59f5e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mm-unification-run","status":"resolved","id":"38760d0fb2c20b34","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-mm-unification-run]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-mm-step-factorization","status":"resolved","id":"3c6237425d7c09fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-mm-step-factorization]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-idempotent-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"94e07ab4a04b0626","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","